{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55319","headline":"题俞公岩 · 陈抟","name":"题俞公岩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万事若在手，百年聊称情。\n他时南[面]（岳）去，记得此岩名。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷八五《均州》。\n）（〖1〗《邵氏闻见录》卷七云：「华山隐士陈抟，字图南，唐长兴中进士，游四方，有大志，隐武当山诗云：『他年南面去，记得此山名。\n』本朝张邓公改『南面』爲『南岳』，题其後云：『藓壁题诗志何大，可怜今老华图南。\n』盖唐末时诗也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈抟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}